		"description": "<p><em>Gadget — Reconfigure your tools into any set you need.</em></p><p><strong>Cast Time: 1 minute.</strong> You transform your tool set into a different one.</p><p><strong>Toolbelt:</strong> The first check you make with these new tools has a +5 bonus.</p><p><strong>Passive:</strong> You always have the last tool set you created.</p><hr><p><em>[A] Grants the Omni-Tool gadget item (activation, 1 scrap) and the \"Omni-Tool (Toolbelt)\" feature (upgrade, 2 scraps); both spend from your Toolbelt pool — tracked on the sheet (click the counter to correct mistakes).</em></p><p><em>[M] Passive: You always have the last tool set you created.</em></p>",
